#
# [name raw]   lines are concatenated exactly as written (JSON fragments).
# [name words] lines are joined with single spaces; the section starts with one space.
# Blank lines and lines starting with # are ignored. Most common material goes LAST
# (DEFLATE references nearby dictionary bytes most cheaply).

